--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Naming
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Python distribution is named `open-threat-model` and the canonical document
uses the `.otm.yaml` extension, because the project implements the Open Threat
Model interchange format. It is an independent implementation and is not the
OTM standard itself, nor is it affiliated with IriusRisk. The product name is
"App Suite Modeling"; `open-threat-model` is the distribution name on PyPI.
